  "notes": "{支援|しえん} is a formal word for support or aid, often used in official, institutional, or news contexts.\n\nCommon expressions:\n- {支援|しえん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to support, to aid)\n- {支援|しえん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧ (to receive support)\n- {支援|しえん}⟦{活動|かつどう}→活動：00201_katsudou⟧ (support activities)\n- ⟦{経済|けいざい}→経済：01394_keizai⟧{支援|しえん} (economic support)\n- ⟦{人道|じんどう}→人道：16121_jindou⟧{支援|しえん} (humanitarian aid)\n- {就労|しゅうろう}{支援|しえん} (employment support)\n\nCompared to ⟦{助|たす}け→助け：07777_tasuke⟧ or ⟦{手伝|てつだ}い→手伝い：02488_tetsudai⟧, {支援|しえん} has a more formal, institutional nuance and is often used for organized or large-scale assistance.",
